{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>In the mountains of them.</b> Like 'in their speaking' — i.e., in their ascending Mount Seir." "<b>As far as El Paran, which is upon the wilderness.</b> Like 'and spread over the Ark,' 'and he stood upon the camels, upon the spring' — so too here: near the wilderness. It is the wilderness of the nations where Israel traveled for forty years." "<b>El Paran.</b> The plain of Paran."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:08.916750601Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}